    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Harmonic Heat-Treat.</strong> You can sing heat into metal in ways that make it remember what it’s for.</p><ul><li>During a short or a Soma Break, you can spend 10 minutes working on a <strong>weapon or suit of armor</strong> you touch.</li><li>Until the next rest, that item gains a small blessing: the wielder gains a +1 bonus to <strong>attack rolls made with that weapon</strong> or to <strong>Guard while wearing that armor</strong> (your choice for each item you treat).</li><li>You can maintain a number of such “Heat-Treated” items at a time equal to your Body modifier (minimum 1). Treating a new item beyond that limit ends the effect on one of your choice.</li></ul>",
